#, no-wrap
msgid "Database"
msgstr "数据库"

#. type: Title #
#: docs/guide/database.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "PostgreSQL Setup and Operations"
msgstr "PostgreSQL 安装与运维"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> FreeAnima uses PostgreSQL for conversation archives, semantic memory, self layer, and related data.\n"
"> Related concepts: [`memory.md`](../concepts/memory.md), [`sleep.md`](../concepts/sleep.md).\n"
"> Security and credentials: [`security.md`](security.md).\n"
msgstr ""
"> 逸灵风使用 PostgreSQL 存储对话存档、语义记忆、自我层及相关数据。\n"
"> 相关概念：[`memory.md`](../concepts/memory.md)、[`sleep.md`](../concepts/sleep.md)。\n"
"> 安全与凭证：[`security.md`](security.md)。\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connection Configuration"
msgstr "连接配置"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:14
msgid "Set the database URL in `config.yaml`:"
msgstr "在 `config.yaml` 中设置数据库 URL："

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/database.md:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"database:\n"
"  url: postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/anima\n"
"  # or use env() / vault():\n"
"  # url: env(\"DATABASE_URL\")\n"
msgstr ""
"database:\n"
"  url: postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/anima\n"
"  # 或使用 env() / vault()：\n"
"  # url: env(\"DATABASE_URL\")\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:23
msgid ""
"Production **must** set `database.url`. Prefer Vault or `env()` for "
"passwords instead of plaintext in config. Path conventions: [`security.md`]"
"(security.md#credential-responsibilities)."
msgstr ""
"生产环境**必须**设置 `database.url`。密码优先使用 Vault 或 `env()`，避免在配"
"置中明文存放。路径约定见 [`security.md`](security.md#credential-"
"responsibilities)。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Local Install (Debian)"
msgstr "本地安装（Debian）"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/database.md:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Install PostgreSQL, create anima db/user (requires sudo)\n"
"sudo ./scripts/setup-postgres-debian.sh\n"
"\n"
"# config.yaml (example):\n"
"#   url: env(\"DATABASE_URL\")\n"
msgstr ""
"# Install PostgreSQL, create anima db/user (requires sudo)\n"
"sudo ./scripts/setup-postgres-debian.sh\n"
"\n"
"# config.yaml (example):\n"
"#   url: env(\"DATABASE_URL\")\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:35
msgid ""
"Defaults: PostgreSQL 17, `localhost` only, `scram-sha-256`, dedicated "
"`anima` database and user."
msgstr ""
"默认：PostgreSQL 17、仅 `localhost`、`scram-sha-256`、专用 `anima` 数据库与用"
"户。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Extensions (One-Time)"
msgstr "扩展（一次性）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:39
msgid ""
"Full-text and vector search require PostgreSQL extensions. The app user "
"usually cannot `CREATE EXTENSION`; run as superuser:"
msgstr ""
"全文与向量检索需要 PostgreSQL 扩展。应用用户通常无法 `CREATE EXTENSION`；请以"
"超级用户执行："

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/database.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo apt install postgresql-17-pgvector   # match psql --version\n"
"sudo -u postgres psql -d anima -f core/scripts/ensure-pg-extensions.sql\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo apt install postgresql-17-pgvector   # match psql --version\n"
"sudo -u postgres psql -d anima -f core/scripts/ensure-pg-extensions.sql\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:46
msgid ""
"Fresh Debian installs via `setup-postgres-debian.sh` handle extensions "
"automatically."
msgstr "通过 `setup-postgres-debian.sh` 全新安装的 Debian 会自动处理扩展。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schema Migrations"
msgstr "Schema 迁移"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:51
msgid ""
"**Production (recommended):** When PostgreSQL is configured, `anima service` "
"**auto-applies** pending schema migrations on startup."
msgstr ""
"**生产环境（推荐）：** 配置 PostgreSQL 后，`anima service` 启动时会**自动应用"
"**待执行的 schema 迁移。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:51
msgid "**Manual:**"
msgstr "**手动：**"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/database.md:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"DATABASE_URL=\"postgresql://anima:…@127.0.0.1:5432/anima\" \\\n"
"  bun run db:migrate\n"
msgstr ""
"DATABASE_URL=\"postgresql://anima:…@127.0.0.1:5432/anima\" \\\n"
"  bun run db:migrate\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:58
msgid "Run after extensions are installed, or restart `anima service`."
msgstr "安装扩展后执行，或重启 `anima service`。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "`auto_llm_runs` (audit)"
msgstr "`auto_llm_runs`（审计）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:62
msgid ""
"Background LLM without user turns (cron agent, sleep pipeline stages) writes "
"to `auto_llm_runs` instead of creating `conversations`. Retention (optional "
"`config.yaml`):"
msgstr ""
"无用户轮次的后台 LLM（cron agent、睡眠流水线阶段）写入 `auto_llm_runs`，而非"
"创建 `conversations`。保留策略（可选 `config.yaml`）："

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/database.md:63
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"auto_llm:\n"
"  retention_days: 30\n"
"  per_run_kind_keep: 100\n"
msgstr ""
"auto_llm:\n"
"  retention_days: 30\n"
"  per_run_kind_keep: 100\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:70
msgid ""
"Purged during sleep-cycle step `conversation-cleanup` (after stale "
"conversation cleanup). Cron script runs (`no_agent`) use `cron_log` only."
msgstr ""
"在 sleep-cycle 步骤 `conversation-cleanup`（过期对话清理之后）中清除。Cron 脚"
"本运行（`no_agent`）仅使用 `cron_log`。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backups"
msgstr "备份"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:76
msgid ""
"**Migrations do not replace backups** — schedule regular full backups (e.g. "
"`pg_dump`)."
msgstr "**迁移不能替代备份** — 请定期安排全量备份（如 `pg_dump`）。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:76
msgid "Back up before destructive changes."
msgstr "破坏性变更前先备份。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:76
msgid ""
"Include `~/.anima/` (`FREEANIMA_HOME` overridable) in backup policy — see "
"[`security.md`](security.md#data-persistence)."
msgstr ""
"备份策略应包含 `~/.anima/`（可用 `FREEANIMA_HOME` 覆盖）——见 [`security.md`]"
"(security.md#data-persistence)。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/database.md:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "Integration Tests (Developers)"
msgstr "集成测试（开发者）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:80
msgid ""
"Full integration tests require **Docker** for a temporary PostgreSQL "
"instance:"
msgstr "完整集成测试需要 **Docker** 提供临时 PostgreSQL 实例："

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/database.md:81
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "bun run test:integration\n"
#| "bun run test              # unit + integration in parallel\n"
msgid ""
"bun run test:integration\n"
"bun run test              # unit + integration（串行）\n"
msgstr ""
"bun run test:integration\n"
"bun run test              # unit + integration in parallel\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:87
msgid "pre-commit `test:changed` does **not** run integration tests."
msgstr "pre-commit 的 `test:changed` **不会**运行集成测试。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:95
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Symptom                     | Check                                                          |\n"
#| "| --------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| Service fails on DB connect | `database.url`; PostgreSQL running; pass credentials readable  |\n"
#| "| Migration fails             | Extensions installed; DB user has DDL privileges               |\n"
#| "| FTS / vector recall empty   | `ensure-pg-extensions.sql` applied; `embedding` config enabled |\n"
msgid ""
"| Symptom                     | Check                                                                       |\n"
"| --------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Service fails on DB connect | `database.url`; PostgreSQL running; pass credentials readable               |\n"
"| Migration fails             | Extensions installed; DB user has DDL privileges                            |\n"
"| FTS / keyword recall empty  | `ensure-pg-extensions.sql` applied (`pg_trgm`); jieba/FTS rebuild if needed |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 现象                        | 排查                                                           |\n"
"| --------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 服务 DB 连接失败            | `database.url`；PostgreSQL 是否运行；pass 凭证是否可读         |\n"
"| 迁移失败                    | 扩展已安装；DB 用户是否有 DDL 权限                             |\n"
"| FTS / 向量召回为空          | 已执行 `ensure-pg-extensions.sql`；已启用 `embedding` 配置     |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:96
msgid "More deployment security: [`security.md`](security.md)."
msgstr "更多部署安全事项：[`security.md`](security.md)。"
